    <h3><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> About LibVault</h3>
    <p>LibVault is a full-featured library management system built to make borrowing and managing books simple
       for both members and administrators. Search the catalogue, check availability in real time, borrow and
       return books online, and keep track of due dates and fines - all in one place.</p>
    <p>Administrators get a complete dashboard to manage the book catalogue, members, issued books, renewals and
       fines from a single screen.</p>
